NoDerivs means exactly what it says: the files in icons/ are byte-for-byte
copies of Amazon's originals and MUST NOT be modified — not recoloured, not
reshaped, not run through an SVG optimizer. Squinch applies theme treatment at
render time (placement, clipping, surrounding plates) and never alters the
asset itself. Regenerate this directory with `npm run fetch`, never by hand.

